      "title": "A Novel Characterization of the Population Area Under the Risk Coverage Curve and Rates of Finite Sample Estimators",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.15361",
      "design_consequence": "Exact empirical AURC is retained, but promotion also requires capture-run-level dependence-aware uncertainty ordering rather than row-count pseudoreplication."
